Applying the transformation $f^{-1}$ leads to:
$$
\begin{align}
\begin{aligned}
p(x_{0}) \dd{x} &= p(x_{0} \leq x \leq x_{0} + \dd{x})  \\
&= p(z_{0})\left.\dv{f^{-1}}{x}\right|_{x=x_{0}}\!\dd{x}.
\end{aligned}
\end{align}
$$
